{"overview":"این فیلم یک اقتباس حماسی و اکشن از شعر حماسی معروف هومر (Odyssey) به حساب می‌آید که داستان سفر طولانی و پرماجرای اودیسئوس (پادشاه ایتاکا) رو بعد از جنگ تروآ روایت می‌کند. او با موجودات اساطیری مثل سایکلوپس (پولیفموس)، سیرن‌ها و سیرسه روبرو شده و سعی می‌کند به خانه و همسرش پنه‌لوپه برگردد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.","tagline_en":"Defy the gods.","runtime":173,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["کریستوفر نولان"],"crew_en":["Christopher Nolan"],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"مت دیمون","role":"Odysseus","photo":"/aCvBXTAR9B1qRjIRzMBYhhbm1fR.jpg","en":"Matt Damon"},{"name":"تام هالند","role":"Telemachus","photo":"/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg","en":"Tom Holland"},{"name":"ان هتوی","role":"Penelope","photo":"/nbccV2pMoyLTCeg5DQip24Eq0Jp.jpg","en":"Anne Hathaway"},{"name":"رابرت پتینسون","role":"Antinous","photo":"/3qZ09UE7lN6AtorfXFRYpEtSY93.jpg","en":"Robert Pattinson"},{"name":"هیمش پاتل","role":"Eurylochus","photo":"/icqsXLmU0FxBGTv63kkA0GcrecO.jpg","en":"Himesh Patel"},{"name":"شارلیز ترون","role":"Calypso","photo":"/gd7ShD0yt4bsR2STeQ19KQ6hvXL.jpg","en":"Charlize Theron"},{"name":"جان لگویزمائو","role":"Eumaeus","photo":"/kwYCdxTlDh9zauUCg4mp2XTCQTw.jpg","en":"John Leguizamo"},{"name":"تراویس اسکات","role":"Bard","photo":"/eBdm7HQS6lLGg4BocgfoJ5qB9yp.jpg","en":"Travis Scott"},{"name":"کوری هاوکینز","role":"Polybus","photo":"/wRt0Bc0chN5BSjvYzmg2evgqNzp.jpg","en":"Corey Hawkins"},{"name":"Jarreth J. Merz","role":"Leodes","photo":"/ze8WDEujZmTXdCLcUy0IaymwlcS.jpg"},{"name":"Niko Nicotera","role":"Peisander","photo":"/ffSAiwXMmvQP1vJuPguLznNpPOI.jpg"},{"name":"الیوت پیج","role":"Sinon","photo":"/wSdlM4Qyoi5AGj5eIIp8Bm0Sfkz.jpg","en":"Elliot Pag